cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Battery Digital Twin: a hybrid physics-empirical digital twin of a lithium-ion or sodium-ion battery cell, with a techno-economic analysis and a screening life cycle assessment"
abstract: "A physics model (PyBaMM, SPMe or DFN with a lumped thermal model) simulates the first cycles of a user-defined test; its state-of-charge swing, C-rates and cell temperature drive empirical capacity-fade models refitted to published ageing data (NMC, LFP, NCA, sodium-ion). The projected capacity feeds a techno-economic analysis of energy arbitrage on the Portuguese day-ahead market and a screening life cycle assessment (ISO 14040/14044)."
